<?php
/**
 * Hand-typed declarations of the FrontAccounting 2.4 API that the import_transactions module uses.
 *
 * FrontAccounting core is untyped procedural PHP; Psalm infers `mixed` for nearly everything it returns.
 * This stub gives the used part of that API real types so the module itself can be analysed at errorLevel 1.
 * Keep it in step with what the module calls; anything not listed here is not used by the module.
 */

